/techseamas/?locale=nb_NO\" target=\"_blank\"","span_exact":true,"extraction_method":"site_mining_v1","snapshot":6}],"summary":{"text":"TECHSEAM AS is a private limited company registered in Sandnes, founded 2005-12-16. TECHSEAM AS develops, produces and sells specialty products within canopies, boat covers, pool covers, tarpaulins and similar items for the private market, and does special sewing for the oil/offshore industry and other companies. It also invests in real estate and provides advisory services and participates in other business activities. Its main industry code is 13.960: manufacture of other technical and industrial textiles. It has 1 registered workplace. In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 11 019 028 NOK and the annual result was 4 073 831 NOK; operating income was up from 9 360 688 NOK in 2024. The annual result rose from 3 468 388 NOK in 2024 to 4 073 831 NOK in 2025. Equity rose from 10 528 456 NOK in 2024 to 11 932 287 NOK in 2025. Registered leadership: Rolf Terje Brathetland (daglig leder and styrets leder), with 1 other board member. Its verified website is techseam.no, which links to its Facebook profile. The register's most recent update was on 2026-10-13 (registreringsdatoAntallAnsatteEnhetsregisteret, registreringsdatoAntallAnsatteNAVAaregisteret).","sentences":[{"text":"TECHSEAM AS is a private limited company registered in Sandnes, founded 2005-12-16.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c6"]},{"text":"TECHSEAM AS develops, produces and sells specialty products within canopies, boat covers, pool covers, tarpaulins and similar items for the private market, and does special sewing for the oil/offshore industry and other companies. It also invests in real estate and provides advisory services and participates in other business activities.","claim_ids":["c10","c9"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 13.960: manufacture of other technical and industrial textiles.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"It has 1 registered workplace.","claim_id